      "writtenOn": "2021-11-08T19:53:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also, as this is set up right now, if one asks for custom_directory_fontmgr one will get it if they explicitly ask for it, but I think one will (eventually) get an undefined symbol error for SkFontMgr::Factory since there is no \"_factory.cpp\" here.\n\nAlso, I\u0027m fairly sure one needs FreeType to use there and I don\u0027t see that being built yet?",
